WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.960
Every workflow in the tenant has a file,

3
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.000
and the last plan showed
no unknown workflows.

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.650
The lint is clean against
a budget of fifty.

5
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:14.250
Every execution limit matches its
file, and the validation kit agrees.

6
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.737
The pass is one-time and lasts
at most twenty-four hours.

7
00:00:17.737 --> 00:00:22.163
Each change reached the tenant as a
reviewed body with its hash recorded.

8
00:00:22.163 --> 00:00:24.613
The readers hold only read permissions.

9
00:00:24.613 --> 00:00:27.938
And the readiness rate is
reported for every start date.

10
00:00:27.938 --> 00:00:33.425
Next, Chapter 4: access from attributes,
and the mover's residual review.

11
00:00:33.425 --> 00:00:34.580
Thanks for watching.
